{"id": "EUVD-2026-72106", "enisaUuid": "85465e59-a498-33c9-a853-37a9a680e565", "description": "h3 versions before 2.0.1-rc.18 fail to validate the chunk count parsed from user-controlled cookie values in setChunkedCookie() and deleteChunkedCookie() functions. Attackers can send a crafted cookie header with an extremely large chunk count to trigger an O(n\u00b2) cleanup loop that hangs the server process.", "datePublished": "2026-09-06T12:00:26", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-18T17:23:10", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/h3js/h3/security/advisories/GHSA-q5pr-72pq-83v3", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/h3-before-2.0.1-rc.18-denial-of-service-via-unbounded-chunked-cookie"], "aliases": ["GHSA-fg72-q65g-wm5w", "CVE-2026-86250"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.49, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ad07c4ec-7dfe-3fda-92fd-0a6c3eb9a7f0", "product": {"name": "h3", "vendor": {"name": "h3js"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0-beta.4 <2.0.1-rc.18"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c0d78eec-3635-3a1c-bf7c-9f8fa3d0b644", "vendor": {"name": "h3js"}}], "isExploited": false}